loneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F^{j,\\mathrm{LFP}}_\\tau,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"F^{\\mathrm{LFP}}_{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi}(X)\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[R:=X]\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x]]\\},\\qquad X\\subseteq|A|^k.","display":true},{"tex":"X_0^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{LFP}}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad X_{i+1}^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{LFP}}\\coloneqq F^{\\mathrm{LFP}}_{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi}(X_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{LFP}}).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}[\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\phi](\\bar t)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bar t^A[\\beta]\\in\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}X_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{LFP}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}([\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\phi](\\bar t))\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x))\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_{\\tau}(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(Qx\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\alpha[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models\\alpha[\\beta],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}(\\neg\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi[\\beta]).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}(\\phi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi[\\beta]\\land A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}(\\phi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi[\\beta]\\lor A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\psi[\\beta]).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}(\\phi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi[\\beta]\\to A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\psi[\\beta])).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]].","display":true},{"tex":"A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"F^{\\mathrm{LFP}}_{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi}","display":false}],"bytes":5979,"backlinks":[{"id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)$ 见 [[29-df-inductive-depth]]；绑定关系 $R$ 和变量组 $\\bar x$ 是资源签名的必要参数。语义取 [[29-df-fo-lfp]] 的 $\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}$。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-lfp]]、[[29-df-fo-pfp]]、[[29-df-fo-tc]] — 逻辑扩张"},{"id":"7f078acfd6f3a69d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9c72e2d86a045838","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8fb20612c81df063","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"两种逻辑的句子与满足关系见 [[29-df-fo-ifp]]、[[29-df-fo-lfp]]。"},{"id":"9e1064efb9350fb3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{P}^{<}[\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-complexity-classes]]；$Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[<])[\\tau]$ 与 $\\operatorname{Mod}_\\tau^{\\mathrm{FO(LFP